{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1223747-question-about-spell-casting","id":1223747,"title":"Question about spell casting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-31T15:37:23-07:00","id":1223747,"title":"Question about spell casting","content":"I had a question regarding spell casting, and the tables given in the book. There's one chart that gives you suggested amount of successes. For example, creating a Firestorm is suggested at 4. There's also the Damage and Duration chart as well. My question is, do you use both charts, or do just split the Damage and Duration between the 4 successes suggested in the first chart?<br /> <br /> For example:<br /> <br /> You want to create a Firestorm that does 6 Damage for the scene. Do you roll with just 4 successes needed, with the first chart? Or do you need 4 successes, +4 more for the Damage /Duration you want ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7550-vulcan7200","name":"Vulcan7200","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-31T17:53:19-07:00","id":1223782,"title":"","content":"It's damage or duration, not both. <br /> <br /> Examples for continuous damage usually spread the damage over the duration not inflict it every turn. Most likely for balancing purposes more than anything else. I'm not saying you couldn't go that route but many more successes might be best if you do.<br /> <br /> Sorry I don't have page references I'm not near books atm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T03:29:41-07:00","id":1223869,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s up to the ST.<br /> <br /> They could say it\u2019s a flat 4 successes and then there\u2019s a firestorm, boom. They decide how much damage it does.<br /> <br /> They could say that the firestorm must be split between dice for damage and targets. So 1 success per target, and 1 per 2 points of damage (plus 1 for being Forces)<br /> <br /> They could even go for both. Saying a minimum<br /> Number of 4 successes is needed to cast the thing, and then extra successes are needed to enhance the damage and include more targets.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}